{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2i_moqQOQb1XYKOF20KimQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:49.276256+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2i_moqQOQb1XYKOF20KimQ","html":"<div><section><section><p><span>我院现组织开展2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生预报名工作，请符合申请条件的申请人（包括本校应届生）按以下通知内容报名：</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>（一）中华人民共和国公民；</span></p><p><span>（二）拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></p><p><span>（三）在目前就读学校取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>（四）学术研究兴趣浓厚，具有较强的创新意识、创新能力和作为博士、硕士研究生培养的潜质；</span></p><p><span>（五）诚实守信，学风端正，未受过任何处分；</span></p><p><span>（六）身体健康状况符合国家和中山大学规定的体检要求；</span></p><p><span>（七）入学前须本科毕业并获得学士学位；</span></p><p><span>（八）其余申请条件要符合中山大学推荐免试研究生招生章程及接收办法中的要求。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/libkIIU3oblV5zXUmG5gm8bKHJicES7eS5aUHt5aibNFeJr6vKNlvetIVtJyQJicSBGKMdhZUYBciaZHSvO8icabJgMw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>说明：实际招生专业以学校最终公布的2026年研究生招生专业目录为准。各专业实际接收推免生人数将根据招生计划、生源情况等进行调整，以实际录取为准。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>（一）历年在校学习成绩单，须盖有推荐学校教务处公章；</span></p><p><span>（二）专业成绩排名证明，加盖有推荐学校的教务处公章；</span></p><p><span>（三）学生证扫描件；</span></p><p><span>（四）身份证扫描件（须正反面复印在A4纸的同一面上）；</span></p><p><span>（五）国家英语四、六级考试成绩或其他外语水平证明材料；</span></p><p><span>（六）在校期间获得的校级奖学金证明材料（如有，请提供）；</span></p><p><span>（七）其它有关材料（该部分材料不作为必须提供材料内容，供我校审核、接收时参考），如获奖证书复印件及申请人提交的体现本人学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等；</span></p><p><span>（八）拟申请直博生项目的考生，需提供1份《攻读博士学位期间拟开展的研究计划》（附件2）和两封具有副高级及以上专业技术职务的专家的推荐信。</span></p><p><span>申请者须承诺所提供信息、材料及申请身份的真实性。一经查证为不属实或不符合我校招生要求的，我校将取消其申请资格、录取资格、入学资格，已入学的取消学籍。</span></p><p><span>申请者若存在有违学术道德、专业伦理、诚实守信等方面的不当行为，一经查实，立即取消其申请资格、录取资格、入学资格，已入学的取消学籍。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>在预报名阶段，符合报名条件的考生，将申请表（附件1）盖章扫描件与上述申请材料按照目录顺序整合成1个PDF文件，文件命名格式：预毕业学校+姓名+身份证号码；于2025年9月5日中午12：00前登录中山大学研究生报名系统（网址：https://enroll.sysu.edu.cn/），填报报名信息，并将以上申请材料上传至报名系统。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、初审与考核</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>我院将对申请材料进行审核，择优确定差额考核名单，发送考核通知，组织考核，考核办法和具体安排另行通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、其他</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>（一）说明</span></p><p><span>此通知为预报名通知，具体要求以教育部及中山大学2026年推荐免试研究生接收工作相关、接收办法通知为准。</span></p><p><span>推免生的报名及录取均通过教育部“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址: https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/）进行。所有推免生（含“免试硕士生”和“直博生”）均需按照教育部、本科所在学校和省市招办要求在规定时间内登录教育部推荐免试服务系统，完成资格审查、填报志愿、缴纳报名费、接受复试确认、接受待录取确认等环节。</span></p><p><span>推免复审及体检要求请留意学校及院系后续发布的推免接收办法及相关通知。</span></p><p><span>（二）联系方式</span></p><p><span> 联系人：郑老师</span></p><p><span> 电话：0756-3668277</span></p><p><span>地址：广东省珠海市香洲区唐家湾中山大学珠海校区海琴6号A568</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>附件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>请点击以下链接或者扫描二维码获取附件1和附件2，提取密码为2580。</span></p><p><span>链接：https://pan.sysu.edu.cn/link/AA561AB2CEF4714DC49E15F417EF616BB8</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/libkIIU3oblV5zXUmG5gm8bKHJicES7eS5WAibNQuawnbWkgZSlOcGMt3XmXXHib7H32IBYTiaNEkwiaPiczhnAVe7ZCg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>您可能错过的精彩</span> </span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwNjI1MzQ3Nw==&amp;mid=2650615732&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=b65fd67f84a011b62eb4f6f3b29277ab&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">知行合一 · 遇“践”云南 | 2022级酒店管理专业实习探访云南旅游业发展</a></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwNjI1MzQ3Nw==&amp;mid=2650615731&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=6aed627a0f09e1f1f5e9d10244a1030f&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">高松：深植教育家精神沃土 锻造新时代强国之师</a></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwNjI1MzQ3Nw==&amp;mid=2650615731&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=5906a86fc43f0f9d15dfc05af5e842c6&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2025粤港澳暨东盟旅游研究与学科建设论坛 二号通知</a></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/libkIIU3oblW1Oxzib2FCR4L45hVlZMiaBkoRNRzFykNxpwnhZ9KicNk6iawXhNfe751LI5MJounh5Tr7ZEOvaqtr0A/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg&amp;randomid=9w4bg83q&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=wxpic\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><p><span><span>图文：郑大政</span></span></p><p><span><span>编辑：凌慧茹</span></span></p><p><span><span>初审：凌慧茹</span></span></p><p><span><span>审核：张骁鸣、赵静</span></span></p><p><span><span>审核发布：徐红罡、黄山</span></span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/libkIIU3oblUrdf3jJwRib2Z9uUoVXQWsqNWK3GVfVAQxkIqKZ1S1oWkrRlB67foWzapwUlA7EFNvGcicPhVeIqbg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=wxpic\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"3b32b324834acea8173cb4eed98d23e63a7c18ce29ec5f326f65301c140913b1","textLength":1612,"sourceSha256":"a44233c991129b91a39ef5d59f04567dcfe836a1d7410f0b405a077c0ad0d30d","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d402c4890b6ccfb18e4f","title":"2025年中山大学旅游学院2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:49.276256+00:00"}
